### ==========================================
### API Documentation - Mobile App (REST Client)
### ==========================================
### Menggunakan loopback IP 127.0.0.1:9090 karena
### dihubungkan menggunakan kabel USB dan ADB reverse port forwarding.
###
### 📱 Persiapan Sebelum Mencoba di HP:
### 1. Hubungkan HP Android ke Laptop menggunakan kabel USB.
### 2. Jalankan perintah di Terminal laptop Anda:
###    adb reverse tcp:9090 tcp:9090
### 3. Jalankan request "Login Admin" di bawah.
### 4. Salin token dari hasil respons, tempel di variabel @token di bawah.
### 5. Jalankan request lainnya dengan lancar!
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:9090
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### ==========================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION (LOGIN)
### ==========================================

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

###

### ==========================================
### 2. CONFIGURATION (SETTINGS)
### ==========================================

# Get Max Projects per Student
# @name getMaxProjects
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/config/max_projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# Update Max Projects per Student
# @name updateMaxProjects
PUT {{baseUrl}}/students/config/max_projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

5

###

### ==========================================
### 3. STUDENTS CRUD API
### ==========================================

# Get All Students
# @name getStudents
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# Create a New Student
# @name createStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/students/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Budi Santoso",
    "average": 8.5
}

###

# Update Student Details
# @name updateStudent
PUT {{baseUrl}}/students/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Budi Santoso (Edited)",
    "average": 9.0
}

###

# Delete Student
# @name deleteStudent
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ==========================================
### 4. PROJECTS CRUD API
### ==========================================

# Get All Projects
# @name getProjects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# Create Project with Files (Multipart Request)
# Catatan: Di VS Code REST Client, unggah file disimulasikan seperti di bawah
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Proyek Akhir Mobile
--WebAppBoundary--

###

# Delete Project
# @name deleteProject
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ==========================================
### 5. ASSIGNMENTS API (PENUGASAN PROYEK)
### ==========================================

# Assign Project to Student
# @name assignProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/students/1/projects/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "startDate": "2026-05-10",
    "endDate": "2026-06-10"
}
